<mxCell id="p3-v27" parent="p3-v26" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc RedeemPoints(RedeemPointsRequest)&lt;br&gt;returns (RedeemPointsResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message RedeemPointsRequest {&lt;br&gt;string idempotency_key = 1;&lt;br&gt;string brand_id = 2;&lt;br&gt;string customer_id = 3;&lt;br&gt;string reward_id = 4;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;response: redemption_id, voucher code,&lt;br&gt;points left&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;IssueVoucher(idempotency_key = redemption_id,&lt;br&gt;brand_id, customer_id, campaign_id)" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v28" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v29" parent="p3-v28" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rewards&lt;br&gt;reward_id, brand_id, campaign_id&lt;br&gt;points_cost, active_from, active_to&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;point_redemptions&lt;br&gt;status pending, done, or failed&lt;br&gt;UNIQUE(brand_id, idempotency_key)&lt;br&gt;voucher_id when done&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;postings&lt;br&gt;kind = redeem, then reverse on failure&lt;br&gt;oldest expiry buckets first&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox&lt;br&gt;the send, after the voucher id is stored" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v30" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v31" parent="p3-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• UNIQUE(brand_id, idempotency_key). A repeat returns the stored response, including after a crash.&lt;br&gt;• IssueVoucher uses redemption_id, so a retry never issues a second code.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline comes from customer-bff. On timeout the redemption stays pending and the worker retries.&lt;br&gt;• Voucher rejects (ended, cap): reversing posting, redemption failed, reason to the shopper.&lt;br&gt;• Still pending after 24 hours: reverse the posting and queue CSC." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v33" parent="p3-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• One call direction: Loyalty calls Voucher. Voucher does not call Loyalty.&lt;br&gt;• Rewards (points cost → campaign_id) are loyalty data, published by admin-bff.&lt;br&gt;• Points are not a checkout tender. The shopper spends them on a reward voucher only.&lt;br&gt;• No loyalty.events. The send is notification.requested." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
</root>
</mxGraphModel>
