<mxCell id="p3-v31" parent="p3-v30" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• UNIQUE on the idempotency_key. A repeat returns the stored result.&lt;br&gt;• SELECT … FOR UPDATE on the member, then the posting.&lt;br&gt;• A debit larger than the balance does not write.&lt;br&gt;• Deadline from admin-bff. Retries only on UNAVAILABLE, at most twice (P-02)." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v32" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p3-v33" parent="p3-v32" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Same shape as a wallet adjust (P-15): one agent, a reason, a limit, no maker-checker in v1.&lt;br&gt;• The limit amount is still open, as it is for the wallet grant.&lt;br&gt;• A replaced card keeps the same member. Counters move; points do not reset." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
