<mxCell id="p6-v22" parent="p6-v21" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A member whose level did not change is a no-op.&lt;br&gt;• Safe to run twice (P-07).&lt;br&gt;• IssueVoucher is idempotent on brand:member:tier:period, so a retry does not issue twice.&lt;br&gt;• If Voucher is down, the level stays and the benefit retries. It is not reversed." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p6-v23" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="p6-v24" parent="p6-v23" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Campaign does not get a tier cache. There is no loyalty.events. A basket that needs the level calls GetMember, and that call is not drawn until Campaign adds it.&lt;br&gt;• No birthday cron. Identity does not publish birth_month.&lt;br&gt;• D-11 and O-20: the level is per brand until cross-brand points are decided." vertex="1">
<mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" />
</mxCell>
